__pycache__/
*.pyc

# AGS/TS typecheck artifacts. `ags types -u` regenerates all of these from the
# GTK/Astal libraries installed on THIS machine: @girs/ is 168 .d.ts files and
# ~49 MB, and node_modules/ holds symlinks into /usr/share/ags/js. They describe
# the local toolchain, not the repo, so they are rebuilt on demand via
# `make capture-types` and never committed. node_modules must never be deployed
# — placement is per-file (gui_tools_app_files), so an unregistered directory
# simply never ships, but it also must never reach a commit.
/src/gui-tools/capture-tool/@girs/
/src/gui-tools/capture-tool/node_modules/
/src/gui-tools/capture-tool/tsconfig.json
/src/gui-tools/capture-tool/env.d.ts
# TypeScript itself, installed with `npm install --no-save typescript` so that
# `npx tsc` resolves from the tool directory without a package.json.
/node_modules/
# @types/node, for the domain unit tests' node:test / node:assert. `make
# capture-test` installs it HERE, on demand, under tests/ and nowhere else (see
# the capture-test-deps target). The location is load-bearing in two independent
# ways, both measured: (a) tsconfig.capture.json pins "types": [], so the GJS
# app's ambient surface is empty by intent; (b) tests/ is BELOW the app config's
# own directory, so the default typeRoots walk never descends into it even if
# that pin were deleted. Relocate it to the repo root or to capture-tool/ and
# the walk reaches it — measured at 66 @types/node files joining the app
# program. The path is ignored explicitly because the capture tool's placement
# is per-file and a committed node_modules is a deployment hazard.
/src/gui-tools/capture-tool/tests/node_modules/
/package-lock.json
/package.json
/src/cli-tools/wallpaper-effects-generator/feedback.md
/src/cli-tools/wallpaper-effects-generator/test.sh

# Dev VM runtime artifacts (downloaded image, working disk, SSH key, seed)
/dev/.images/

# CSG determinism verification artifact — machine-specific (timestamp, host template hash, podman state)
# Written by src/runtime/tests/integration/test_csg_determinism.py atomically; not for version control
/src/runtime/tests/integration/.csg_determinism.json
